==============================================================================
Running Focal Tversky Test
==============================================================================

This tests if focal_tversky loss handles class imbalance better.

Why focal_tversky?
  - Designed for severe class imbalance (92% background)
  - Penalizes false negatives more (α=0.7, β=0.3)
  - Focuses on hard examples (γ=1.33)
  - Better for small object detection (microbeads)

Expected improvements:
  ✓ Val Jaccard: 3% → 10-20%
  ✓ Degradation: 78% → <50%
  ✓ Overfitting: 10.5× → <5×

==============================================================================

